---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import PawIcon from '../components/PawIcon.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Shopping Sloth"
  description="Slow, thorough product roundups checked against real reviews and testing data."
>
  <div class="wrap prose" style="max-width:760px;">
    <div class="page-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <PawIcon size={12} />
        about us
      </div>
      <h1>Slow picks. Fast results.</h1>
    </div>

    <p>
      Here's the thing about sloths: they move at about 0.15 miles per hour. They sleep up to 15 hours a
      day. They will not be rushed.
    </p>
    <p>
      But sloths are also incredibly deliberate. Every move they make is efficient, necessary, and
      considered. If a sloth is going somewhere, it's going somewhere good. That's basically our whole
      editorial philosophy.
    </p>

    <h2>Why a sloth?</h2>
    <p>
      We got tired of "top 10" lists clearly written in twenty minutes by someone who never read past
      the first review. So we decided to be the opposite: slow, thorough, and mildly suspicious of
      anything claiming to be "revolutionary."
    </p>

    <h2>What we actually do</h2>
    <p>
      Every pick is checked against reviews and testing data from sources that actually put products
      through the wringer. We take our time before telling you what's worth buying.
    </p>

    <h2>A note on affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      Some of our links are affiliate links, and we may earn a small commission if you buy through them,
      at no extra cost to you. Commissions never influence our picks.
    </p>

    <div class="quote" style="margin:56px 0;">
      <p>"We move slow, but only toward the good stuff."</p>
      <span>— the shopping sloth team</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
